id": 2, "time": "20000", "image": "engenn5le11ob09re2img09.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think the traffic is crazy here. Could you go down quieter roads?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: I'll see what I can do. Here. This is better. We can see where people live.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'd say that this is the real Cairo.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: Yes,  Miss, it is.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Mohammed, would you take me to the El-Azmek Garden?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Guide</span>: I'd be glad to, Miss.<br>", "id": 3, "time": "38000", "image": "engenn5le11ob09re2img09.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le11ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le11ob09re2img07.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}